135
00:08:48.467 --> 00:08:50.667
♪ It’s not about hiding data. ♪

136
00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:53.907
♪ It’s about hiding decisions. (Decisions!) ♪

137
00:08:53.907 --> 00:08:56.527
♪ And don’t hide what callers need to know: ♪

138
00:08:56.527 --> 00:09:01.107
