139
00:09:01.107 --> 00:09:03.067
[music]

140
00:09:03.067 --> 00:09:08.339
(narrator) The change test: a checklist, list the likely changes, pick one, count the modules it touches.

141
00:09:08.339 --> 00:09:15.910
(narrator) For a new payment provider, a well-hidden design lights only the gateway, you’re good; a leaky design lights all six modules, redesign.

142
00:09:16.513 --> 00:09:20.473
♪ Not sure you hid it well? Run the change test: ♪

143
