144
00:09:22.693 --> 00:09:26.073
♪ Pick one. Count the modules that would change. ♪

145
00:09:26.073 --> 00:09:30.100
♪ Just one? (You’re good!) Dozens? (Redesign!) ♪

146
00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:33.953
(narrator) The pop quiz: seven cards, each with a question and then the answer.

147
00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:39.160
♪ Pop quiz, agent! Y2K: what got copied everywhere? ♪

148
00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.460
